==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup> delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
**When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
**3 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
**1 [[Chickful A]] spawns.
**1 [[Winged Pigge]] spawns.

==Strategy==
[[Ramen Cat]] completely walls this entire stage, leaving it easy prey for your backliners and Ubers.

